{
    "title": "Cartoon Comic Strip Maker",
    "description": "Cartoon strip maker allows you to create an awesome comic strip, book, storyboard, and meme. You just need to select a cartoon character, background image, and speech bubbles to write your story. It provides a very fun way to express yourself and tell a funny story. Choose your favorite characters from 100+ anime, avtar, superheroes, and add a background with a speech bubble to show your imagination. It also educates how you can show or explain complex stories and concepts using images and dialogue. You can find characters with different emotions which will help you to express or explain your stories.\r\nWhether you're creating a story for storyboarding, storytelling, or for your friends & kids, this app helps you to create a work of art to be proud of. Share your stories on Facebook, Twitter, and other social media channels to make your friends laugh!\r\n\r\nHow to create :\r\n- Choose the storyboard layout.\r\n- Choose characters.\r\n- Add the background.\r\n- Write the text in the speech bubble.\r\n- Share your story with all.\r\n\r\nBest features:\r\n* Anime, Superhero & other characters to choose from.\r\n* Different types of speech bubbles.\r\n* Hd backgrounds.\r\n* Save as a pdf or image.\r\n* Professional cartoonist and artist-made strip pages.\r\n* Share your story with all.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Cartoon strip maker allows you to create an awesome comic strip, book, storyboard, and meme. You just need to select a cartoon character, background image, and speech bubbles to write your story. It provides a very fun way to express yourself and tell a funny story. Choose your favorite characters from 100+ anime, avtar, superheroes, and add a background with a speech bubble to show your imagination. It also educates how you can show or explain complex stories and concepts using images and dialogue. You can find characters with different emotions which will help you to express or explain your stories.<br>Whether you&#39;re creating a story for storyboarding, storytelling, or for your friends &amp; kids, this app helps you to create a work of art to be proud of. Share your stories on Facebook, Twitter, and other social media channels to make your friends laugh!<br><br>How to create :<br>- Choose the storyboard layout.<br>- Choose characters.<br>- Add the background.<br>- Write the text in the speech bubble.<br>- Share your story with all.<br><br>Best features:<br>* Anime, Superhero &amp; other characters to choose from.<br>* Different types of speech bubbles.<br>* Hd backgrounds.<br>* Save as a pdf or image.<br>* Professional cartoonist and artist-made strip pages.<br>* Share your story with all.",
